ve, 2-3 distinct HARD-hold reasons) using only real ids; verify idempotency via sha256 across local x2 + a from-scratch git-stripped CI-layout-simulation copy; run the existing test suite; merge via GitHub API server-side merge after verifying pure forward progress (gh api compare, ahead_by>0/behind_by=0/merge_base=old-tip) per ADR-2607022900; fire a REAL workflow_dispatch and poll to actual completion; curl the REAL live GitHub Pages URL. Every agent was told explicitly to DROP rather than force a fit if verification failed at any step, and that skipping any step 'because the template already worked elsewhere' is precisely the failure mode this rollout's guardrail exists to prevent.", :event/verification "RESULT: 4/5 closed cleanly, 1/5 correctly dropped -- none forced. CLOSED, each independently verified (not self-reported from a shared script, 5 separate agent processes each ran the full pipeline): (1) cloud-itonami-isic-0230 (nwfp/NWFP-gathering-coordination) -- merge commit d4943ee8f73777ef17f49e4ad6ec363b9348211a (https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0230/commit/d4943ee8f73777ef17f49e4ad6ec363b9348211a), live run https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0230/actions/runs/29652956430 conclusion=success with commit-when-changed step logging 'console unchanged', sha256 3cad28e86c3ffdb36d54125f16165dd2e0d972f7cb641e05c0606a3d74fb451f identical across local x2 + CI-layout-sim + live Pages fetch, tests 66/161 assertions/0 failures, live Pages https://cloud-itonami.github.io/cloud-itonami-isic-0230/samples/operator-console.html confirmed serving real site-001/002/003 ids and 3 distinct real HARD-hold rules (site-not-verified/harvest-quota-exceeded/order-total-mismatch); nwfp.sim was verified CORRECT (mined directly, isic-6820-style). (2) cloud-itonami-isic-2818 (powertoolmfg/power-tool-manufacturing) -- merge commit dde017e51a10fe04dc53626572b6e11f21551c18, live run https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-2818/actions/runs/296529