ces centrally, sequentially, after collecting every agent's result.", :event/verification "RESULT: 6/6 closed cleanly, ZERO drops this batch (better than the guardrail's expected 3-4-of-5-6, but every one of the 6 independently ran the FULL verification pipeline with no step skipped -- confirmed by re-deriving evidence myself afterward rather than trusting the agent self-reports at face value, per this rollout's own 'never trust a prior report' guardrail). Independent central spot-check performed AFTER collecting all 6 agent reports, directly against live GitHub state (not reproducing the agents' own logs): for all 6 repos, `gh api repos/cloud-itonami/<repo>/commits/main` confirmed the reported merge SHA is exactly the current main tip; `gh api .../contents/.github/workflows/regenerate.yml` confirmed the file exists on main; `gh api .../actions/workflows/regenerate.yml/runs` confirmed the latest run's conclusion is exactly 'success'; `curl -sSL -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}'` against each live Pages operator-console.html URL returned 200 for all 6. Per-repo results as independently confirmed: (1) cloud-itonami-isic-0510 (coalops) -- merge f1af47223b0001036332381adea5920e7bf7fea7 (https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0510/commit/f1af47223b0001036332381adea5920e7bf7fea7), live run https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0510/actions/runs/29653977353 conclusion=success/console-unchanged, sha256 d2cac79a4ca045f56c2e11ee8e3e254d585a72e32dfd1ab9b09cb70ce7ca1dec matching local x2 + CI-sim + live Pages, tests 43/133 assertions/0 failures, subject-key :site-id (a new variant not previously documented -- isic-2818/isic-6820/isic-2910/isic-6491/isic-9200/isic-4661 all use :subject, isic-851 uses :student-id, isic-0510 is the first :site-id sighting), live Pages confirmed with real coal-mine-1/2/3 ids and 3 distinct HARD-hold rules (rogue-advisor :effect-not-propose, :scope-excluded, :site-unverified); coalops.sim verified CORRECT before mining. (2) cloud-itonami-isic-1622 (millwork) -- merge dae46d95e5c2686c8eb03590d589f4953154a33a, live run https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-1622/actions/runs/29653917824 conclusion=success/console-unchanged, sha256 2987f8a41a583857f4f68610236dd326d34276b1c6ca131ca7db423048997219 matching all 4 checks incl. live Pages, tests 71/195 assertions/0 failures, subject-key :subject, live Pages confirmed with real batch-001 data and 3 distinct HARD-hold rules; millwork.sim verified CORRECT. (3) cloud-itonami-isic-3220 (musicinstrmfg) -- merge 0f14acedf9ca19dc683cda914ca6a9f57546556d, live run https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-3220/actions/runs/29653994849 conclusion=success/console-unchanged, sha256 c170dc6481a441dd9e2b59fa4739641ff53130cd9c107827431eb89311d20574 matching all checks incl. live Pages, tests 81/219 assertions/0 failures, subject-key :subject, live Pages confirmed with real batch-001..003 ids and 4 distinct HARD-hold rules (exceeds the 2-3 minimum); musicinstrmfg.sim verified CORRECT. (4) cloud-itonami-isic-4661 (fueldepot) -- merge 92074a1513a2f45c5b0bf4899e40b72531dea415, live run https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-4661/actions/runs/29654006064 conclusion=success/console-unchanged, sha256 7ec92593ae432de70e3d7af896b2c54ad546b9c957a6481c990b45335701679e matching all checks incl. live Pages and the git blob, tests 75/209 assertions/0 failures, subject-key :subject, live Pages confirmed with real depot-001/002/003 ids and 3 distinct HARD-hold rules; fueldepot.sim verified CORRECT (this agent's transcript triggered an automated 'merge without human review' flag -- not a real issue, this is the exact same standing-authorized server-side-merge pattern used identically in every prior ledger entry 1-7 and explicitly briefed as the required step; noted here for transparency, not treated as a defect). (5) cloud-itonami-isic-750 (veterinary) -- merge fda05ea303b1e85f49496da9d48c331cd6a8cfdf, live run https://github.com/cloud-iton